SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Nikodimos\, patron of Naxos\, Chora
LOCATION:Naxos Chora\, Naxos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:St Nikodimos the Hagiorite was born in Naxos town and is the island's patron: on the evening of 13 July there is a multi-bishop vespers at his church in Chora\, on the 14th the liturgy\, and in the evening the procession of his icon and relics through the streets of the town with the band and the authorities. Religious rather than a food panigiri\, but the town is at its most festive.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/naxos/#naxos-chora-feast-of-agios-nikodimos-patron-of-naxos-chora
